                        <div id="morea" class="text-discription" style="display:none">
                        <p>
	<strong>Govardhangiri: Beautiful living spaces at Goregaon Mumbai! </strong></p>
<p>
	Atul Projects India Ltd has launched <a href="https://www.360realtors.com/kinner-govardhangiri-goregaon-west-mumbai-uid-4482" title=" Govardhangiri Price, Govardhangiri Mumbai ">Govardhangiri</a>, in Goregaon Mumbai. The residential property has 2.5 BHK residences with carpet area of 758 sq. ft. The complex has 2 podiums with 20 floors and 2 wings. The residences are surrounded by wide open spaces and gardens which provide a calm and serene environment away from the hustle and bustle of the city.</p>
<p>
	The residential project comes with various facilities like express lifts, water storage, fire-fighting systems, gymnasium, car parking, power backup, internet connectivity, maintenance staff, and 24-hour security personnel. The development has vitrified flooring, anti-skid tiles, a modern kitchen with dishwasher, anodized aluminum sliding windows, weather proof paints, and concealed copper wiring. It is an affordable <a href="https://www.360realtors.com/2.5bhk-property-in-goregaon-mumbai-rtal-184-10" title=" 2.5 BHK Property in Goregaon Mumbai, 2.5 BHK Apartments in Goregaon Mumbai ">2.5 BHK property in Goregaon Mumbai</a>. The eco-friendly project has rainwater harvesting, waste management facility, and allows abundant natural light and fresh air. The complex has multiple parking levels, air conditioned entrance lobby, an integrated safety &amp; security system, and a Wi-Fi enabled and air conditioned fitness centre for fitness enthusiasts.</p>
<p>
	Located at, Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West, Govardhangiri are one of the most sought after <a href="https://www.360realtors.com/residential-projects-in-mumbai" title=" Residential Apartments in Mumbai, Flats in Mumbai ">residential apartments in Mumbai</a>. The development is well-connected to the rest of the city and has a number of social and civic amenities. The Sai Baba Temple, MDP Road Ground, HyperCITY, and India Post Bangur Nagar are within a few minutes of the project. The Maharaja Agrasen Marg, MDP Road, Road Number 2, and Unnat Nagar Road Number 2, connects the project to surrounding areas.</p>
<p>
	Goregaon is one of the fastest growing suburbs of Mumbai, and is a glamorous yet peaceful location to live in. The Goregaon Railway Station and BEST buses are the inland transport facility. The area has a number of new flyovers, such as a bridge directly connecting Goregaon west and east, and a new railway station in Ram Mandir. The GMLR [Goregaon Mulund Link Road] will connect Goregaon to Bhandup. The Goregaon bus depot at Goregaon west station connects to the entire city.</p>
<p>
	There are a number of leading schools and colleges in the area including VIBGYOR, St. John&rsquo;s Universal, and VivekVidyalaya. Apart from this, a number of leading hotels, hospitals, shopping malls, etc. are near the project. <a href="https://www.360realtors.com/kinner-govardhangiri-goregaon-west-mumbai-uid-4482" title=" Govardhangiri Price, Govardhangiri Mumbai ">Govardhangiri price</a> starts at just Rs 2.54 crores. The developer is offering a number of home loan and easy payment schemes for home buyers and investors.</p>
<p>
	Atul Projects India Ltd. is a leading real-estate developer is India. The company has created a number of landmark projects over the last few years and is dedicated to creating upgraded lifestyles with high-quality for homebuyers, at a value-for-money price. The company has developed over 200 projects till date across residential, office, retail, and hospitality spaces in Mumbai, Pune, Rajkot, and Dubai. The groups latest offering Govardhangiri is an ideal destination for home buyers with its plethora of amenities and excellent location. So hurry and book your home now!</p><span class="about_read"><a href="JavaScript:Void(0)" id="lessbtna" onclick="readLessb();" style="display: block;">Read Less</a>
